tyle=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">본 프로그램은 한국인 대학생과 외국인 유학생이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1:1 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">짝을 이루어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">전시와 부산 영도의 도자기 역사 현장을 함께 탐방하는 당일 프로그램으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, 우리 대학 학생들&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">운영일시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2026. 10. 24.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), 10. 31.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 10:00 ~ 16:00 (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">당일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">회차별 택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">프로그램명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">사물의 길을 따라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">영도를 걷다</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">」 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">한국인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">× </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">외국인 버디 투어</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">주요내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">국립해양박물관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">사물의 이동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">전시 관람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">대한도기 터 문화관광해설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">영도대교 도개 관람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(10/24) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">또는 깡깡이예술마을 탐방</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(10/31), </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">흰여울문화마을 버디 미션</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2026. 10. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">회차별 정원 마감 시까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">선착순</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">온라인 신청서 작성</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">참여대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-size:12.0pt;\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-U